              "elType": "widget",
              "settings": {
                "html": "<div class=\"announce\" role=\"status\">\n  <b style=\"color: var(--crimson-400);\">&bull;</b> Now booking Q3 &middot; <b>Montreal &middot; Toronto &middot; Miami &middot; Rabat</b> &middot; <b style=\"color: var(--crimson-400);\">&bull;</b> Odoo 17 migrations scheduling 6 weeks out\n</div>\n\n<nav class=\"nd-sitenav\" aria-label=\"Primary\">\n  <div class=\"nd-sitenav__inner\">\n    <a href=\"/\" class=\"nd-sitenav__brand\" aria-label=\"Noordev home\">noordev<span class=\"dot\"></span></a>\n    <ul class=\"nd-sitenav__links\">\n      <li>\n        <button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"nd-mega-services\" id=\"nd-services-trigger\" data-nav-key=\"services\">\n          Services\n          <svg class=\"caret\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M2 4 L5 7 L8 4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg>\n        </button>\n      </li>\n      <li><a href=\"/odoo/\"          data-nav-key=\"odoo\">Odoo</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/security/\"      data-nav-key=\"security\">Security</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/training/\"      data-nav-key=\"training\">Training</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/case-studies/\"  data-nav-key=\"work\">Our work</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/about/\"         data-nav-key=\"about\">About</a></li>\n    </ul>\n    <div class=\"nd-sitenav__right\">\n      <span class=\"nd-sitenav__lang\"><b>EN</b> &middot; FR</span>\n      <a class=\"nd-sitenav__cta\" href=\"/contact/\">Book a call</a>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"nd-mega-wrap\" id=\"nd-mega-services\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Services menu\">\n      <div class=\"nd-mega\" data-mega>\n        <div class=\"nd-mega__grid\">\n          <aside class=\"nd-mega__rail\" aria-label=\"Service categories\">\n            <div class=\"nd-mega__rail-label\">Categories</div>\n            <button class=\"nd-mega__rail-item\" aria-selected=\"true\"  data-rail=\