div><span class=\"nd-svc__num\">02 &middot; Marketing</span><h4 class=\"nd-svc__title\">Digital marketing <span class=\"nd-svc__arrow\">&rarr;</span></h4><p class=\"nd-svc__desc\">SEO, content, paid, CRM, attribution &mdash; fluent in bilingual markets.</p><span class=\"nd-svc__tag \">Retainer + sprints</span></div></a>\n                <a href=\"/services/\" class=\"nd-svc\"><span class=\"nd-svc__icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"4\" width=\"18\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M3 9 H21 M9 14 H15\"/></svg></span><div><span class=\"nd-svc__num\">03 &middot; Platform</span><h4 class=\"nd-svc__title\">Odoo ERP <span class=\"nd-svc__arrow\">&rarr;</span></h4><p class=\"nd-svc__desc\">Implementation, migration, customization, support. Gold partner.</p><span class=\"nd-svc__tag \">Gold partner &middot; 14 yrs</span></div></a>\n                <a href=\"/services/\" class=\"nd-svc\"><span class=\"nd-svc__icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 17 L10 11 L14 15 L20 7\"/><path d=\"M14 7 H20 V13\"/></svg></span><div><span class=\"nd-svc__num\">04 &middot; Web</span><h4 class=\"nd-svc__title\">Web &amp; apps <span class=\"nd-svc__arrow\">&rarr;</span></h4><p class=\"nd-svc__desc\">Marketing sites, portals, custom apps. Odoo-native or standalone.</p><span class=\"nd-svc__tag \">Design + build</span></div></a>\n                <a href=\"/security/\" class=\"nd-svc\"><span class=\"nd-svc__icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M12 3 L20 6 V12 C20 17 16 20 12 21 C8 20 4 17 4 12 V6 Z\"/><path d=\"M9 12 L11 14 L15 10\"/></svg></span><div><span class=\"nd-svc__num\">05 &middot; Security</span><h4 class=\"nd-svc__title\">Cybersecurity &amp; GRC <span class=\"nd-svc__arrow\">&rarr;</span></h4><p class=\"nd-svc__desc\">Risk program, policy, controls, audit prep, fractional CISO.</p><span class=\"nd-svc__tag new\">Growing fast</span></div></a>\n                <a href=\"/security/\" class=\"nd-svc\"><span class=\"nd-svc__icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"8\"/><path d=\"M8 12 L11 15 L16 9\"/></svg></span><div><span class=\"nd-svc__num\">06 &middot; ISO 27001</span><h4 class=\"nd-svc__title\">ISO 27001:2022 <span class=\"nd-svc__arrow\">&rarr;</span></h4><p class=\"nd-svc__desc\">ISMS, Statement of Applicability, 93 Annex A controls, certification.</p><span class=\"nd-svc__tag \">11-month path</span></div></a>\n                <a href=\"/services/\" class=\"nd-svc\"><span class=\"nd-svc__icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M3 8 L12 4 L21 8 L12 12 Z\"/><path d=\"M7 10 V16 C7 17 9 18 12 18 C15 18 17 17 17 16 V10\"/></svg></span><div><span class=\"nd-svc__num\">07 &middot; Training</span><h4 class=\"nd-svc__title\">Corporate training <span class=\"nd-svc__arrow\">&rarr;</span></h4><p class=\"nd-svc__desc\">ISO 27001 auditor, Odoo admin, secure dev, bilingual cohorts.</p><span class=\"nd-svc__tag \">EN &middot; FR &middot; AR</span></div></a>\n                <a href=\"/services/\" class=\"nd-svc\"><span class=\"nd-svc__icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 6 H20 M4 12 H20 M4 18 H14\"/><circle cx=\"18\" cy=\"18\" r=\"2\"/></svg></span><div><span class=\"nd-svc__num\">08 &middot; Advisory</span><h4 class=\"nd-svc__title\">Fractional leadership <span class=\"nd-svc__arrow\">&rarr;</span></h4><p class=\"nd-svc__desc\">vCISO, CTO-in-residence, CMO-for-hire. Four days a month.</p><span class=\"nd-svc__tag \">Monthly retainer</span></div></a>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"nd-mega__panel\" data-panel=\"brand\">\n              <div class=\"nd-mega__panel-head\"><h3>Brand &amp; marketing &mdash; <span class=\"italic\">stories that convert</span>.</h3><span class=\"count\">02 Services</span></div>\n              <div class=\"nd-services-grid\">\n                <a href=\"/services/\" class=\"nd-svc\"><span class=\"nd-svc__icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\"/><path d=\"M3 12 H21 M12 3 C15 6 15 18 12 21 C9 18 9 6